  "contentMap": "# Content map\r\n\r\nEach page is its own HTML file. The header is repeated in every page. Styles are `css/styles.css`. Shared behavior is `js/main.js`. Photos and the logo are under `images/deck/logo-horizontal.png`.\r\n\r\n- Home is `index.html`.\r\n- About, staff titles, and the board list are in `about-us.html`. A person's title is the role line inside that person's card.\r\n- What we do is `what-we-do.html`.\r\n- Get involved is `get-involved.html`.\r\n- Impact is `impact.html`.\r\n- Contact is `contact.html`.\r\n- Donate is `give.html`.\r\n- News is `news.html`.\r\n- Events is `events-1.html`.\r\n\r\nThere is no separate data file for posts, staff, or events. Add a news item in `news.html`. Add a staff member by adding a card in `about-us.html`.\r\n"
